# Sample Session Layout for ooda-tui

File: examples/session.oot

A session lives under `~/.local/share/ooda-tui/sessions/<sid>/` where
`<sid>` is a 4-character short id (e.g. `a3f8`). The directory contains
five files at minimum.

## Files

```
sessions/
└── a3f8/                           # short id
    ├── meta.json                   # session metadata
    ├── transcript.jsonl            # append-only log of user/assistant/tool turns
    ├── compacted.json              # last compaction summary (optional)
    ├── plan.json                   # current /plan content (optional)
    ├── goal.txt                    # current /goal content (optional)
    ├── agent-1.proof.json          # teamwork agent proof (optional)
    ├── agent-2.proof.json          # teamwork agent proof (optional)
    └── teamwork.proof.json         # aggregated teamwork proof (optional)
```

## meta.json shape

```
{
  "id": "a3f8",
  "name": "refactor auth module",
  "created": "2026-09-12T20:00:00Z",
  "provider": "anthropic",
  "model": "claude-sonnet-4.5",
  "cwd": "/home/user/project",
  "teamwork": false,
  "yolo": false
}
```

## transcript.jsonl shape

Each line is one turn. Role is one of: user, assistant, tool, side.
Tags preserve the conversation structure for replay on /resume.

```
{"ts": "2026-09-12T20:00:01Z", "role": "user", "kind": "main", "content": "refactor auth.oo"}
{"ts": "2026-09-12T20:00:02Z", "role": "assistant", "content": "Reading auth.oo now."}
{"ts": "2026-09-12T20:00:03Z", "role": "tool", "name": "read_file", "args": {"path": "auth.oo"}, "result": "..."}
{"ts": "2026-09-12T20:00:04Z", "role": "assistant", "content": "Refactor complete."}
```

## plan.json shape

```
{
  "steps": [
    {"step": "read auth.oo", "status": "done"},
    {"step": "extract session module", "status": "done"},
    {"step": "update callers", "status": "pending"}
  ]
}
```

## goal.txt

Plain text. The session's stated objective. /goal sets it; /goal shows it.
